est video to date  well this leaves me here 100k  again thank you so much for being part  of this journey with me  and looking at some of the heartfelt  comments that have been left in my  videos really means the world and  continues to inspire me as i produce  content  i'm awesome on thank yous a brief shout  out to a smaller channel  toasters who's been running the discord  server head on down there if you haven't  already  i've even met some of you on there and  it's been really great to see you  i've also just set up a channel  instagram and twitter so follow me there  for more content  a final thanks is to bim a really good  friend of mine and a channels og  subscriber  you'll know who you are i'll end my  video with this  if you're wanting to make a channel  produce music write a book  or do anything else creative you  absolutely can  the key thing is just to start it  doesn't matter whether it's good or not  what matters is that you've started the  trick to help me to make these videos  is the 70 percent rule just do things at  70 of your capability  and allow you to move forward and not  get bogged down by the finer details  perfectionism really stifles creativity  anyway if you want to start something  new just go for it  anyone can be creative just begin and  see where it takes you  oh and if you're wondering season 2 is  dropping later this month  get ready i think you'll enjoy what's on  the way  we've only just begun

